# The shard's unstamped watermark lives in memory. Restarting without taking every
# offset below the allocator as possibly unstamped forgets an unstamped append made
# before the restart, so a later stamped append reports nothing. Moved from the
# design's mutation of the same name.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestRestartForgetsUnstamped
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a restarted shard forgets the unstamped appends made before it
PERTURBS: Restart
BOUNDS: WithRestart = TRUE, WithPreArm = FALSE

--- FIND
    /\ lastU' = next - 1
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the watermark is lost.
    /\ lastU' = -1
--- END
